  (text "TALOS DRIVER MODULE rev 0.1: a plug-in for the Talos controller's Pololu G2 18v17 sockets. One brushed DC motor, 12 V. See README.md." (at 25.4 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "1b0e401c-ef13-54ee-892f-b7ad351e1a99"))
  (text "J1: the 16 socket pins (two 1x8 male strips, soldered from the top, pins down). Pads 1-4 are two holes each. VM (5) and 3V3 (6) are not connected." (at 25.4 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "1a055eca-3050-513e-8501-23536dd7f872"))
  (text "GND is one net. In the layout the signal ground joins the power ground at one point. R1 pins 3 and 4 are its Kelvin sense taps (net-tied pads)." (at 25.4 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "a6ae1b5b-42db-55be-9194-a0e71d076f0e"))
  (text "CS offset: fit exactly one of R3A (PWM to CS, fitted by default) and R3B (DVDD to CS, not fitted) per batch." (at 25.4 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "f0f1f92d-f097-5f4f-b4ec-255cf8a740f5"))
  (text "R8: 22 Ohm with C12 (1 nF, SP to SN at U1) filters the sense inputs; 100 Ohm is the option if SP overshoots in a short-circuit test." (at 25.4 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "3fc60c2e-2c0a-5a44-962f-fc20ef8fb911"))
